      "name": "Orrery",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "concentrate"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Until it acts, the radiant warden appears to be an orrery (or similar large mechanical contraption, such as a telescope). It has an automatic result of 53 on Deception checks and DCs to convincingly pass as such a machine.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Radiant Blast",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "force",
        "occult"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The radiant warden releases a 50ft Type:cone of bright energy that deals 10d12 Force Damage damage (Basic DC 38 Reflex Saving Throw save). The radiant warden can't use Radiant Blast for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Radiant Blow",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>When a creature is hit by the radiant warden's hammer Strike, a flash of radiant energy attempts to anchor the creature in place. The creature must attempt a DC 38 Will Saving Throw save; on a failure, the creature can't use any teleportation effects for 1 minute. On a critical failure, the creature is also permanently Blinded.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
